{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sect House is a survival horror game with psychological elements and mind-bending puzzles. You play as a child whose once-happy life is shattered after your parents join a sinister cult led by a monstrous pastor. Trapped in a nightmarish home, you must explore shifting environments, solve eerie puzzles, and without falling into the hands of the pastor. Can you escape the house?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711350/extras/1632ae0670d571f9cf5d7bca441937f1.avif?t=1748807897\" width=800 height=232 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore locations and move along the plot. Look for objects and solve puzzles in the game to move on and escape from the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Story</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two endings of the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item selection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various locations</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Death","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3711350/8ce784c6f2a4cb9bd2f72fbebdc302415cc0c5ec.jpg"},{"name":"Flashlight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3711350/6a8613833fe41030f286f2ef82b354e0f5740067.jpg"},{"name":"Nightmare","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3711350/b16007da77d5f62ef0c2c98ec6b8259ae8812824.jpg"},{"name":"Four Sins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3711350/4fe4baeb79fc27bd477d51c313e05767e0611b08.jpg"},{"name":"Door Code","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/publi